/* T1 셸: 최종 아트/스타일은 Manyfast V9 승인 전까지 회색 박스로 둔다 (docs/00_TATS_SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md). */

.title-screen {
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: rgb(24, 26, 30);
    padding: 5%;
}

.title-screen__logo {
    width: 40%;
    min-width: 240px;
    max-width: 480px;
    height: 18%;
    min-height: 96px;
    max-height: 160px;
    margin-bottom: 5%;
    background-color: rgb(64, 67, 74);
    border-radius: 4px;
}

.title-screen__menu {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 32%;
    min-width: 280px;
    max-width: 420px;
}

.title-screen__menu-item {
    min-height: 44px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    font-size: 20px;
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
    color: rgb(232, 234, 237);
    background-color: rgb(42, 45, 52);
    border-width: 2px;
    border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
    border-radius: 4px;
}

.title-screen__menu-item:hover {
    background-color: rgb(54, 58, 66);
}

.title-screen__menu-item:focus,
.title-screen__menu-item--focused {
    background-color: rgb(54, 58, 66);
    border-color: rgb(122, 171, 255);
}
